graph LR
    Repo["llm-d-autoscaling<br/>KEDA blueprints + benchmark"]
    WVA["WVA controller<br/>legacy, deprecated"]
    Repo -.->|"carries frozen code in legacy/"| WVA

    %% External dependencies - current model
    Repo -->|autoscaling engine| KEDA["KEDA<br/>v2.18.0 Go API"]
    Repo -->|trigger metrics| Prom["Prometheus / Thanos Querier"]
    Repo -->|evaluation harness| Bench[llm-d-benchmark]

    %% External dependencies - legacy controller
    WVA -->|framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.22.5"]
    WVA -->|clients| ClientGo["client-go v0.34.5"]
    WVA -->|metrics API + registry| PromClient["prometheus/client_golang v1.23.2"]
    WVA -->|queueing model| Kalman["kalman-filter v0.1.2"]
    WVA -->|optimization| Gonum["gonum v0.17.0"]
    WVA -->|ServiceMonitor / PrometheusRule| PromOp["prometheus-operator v0.89.0"]
    WVA -->|PromQL + metric sink| Prom
    WVA -.->|optional ScaledObject discovery| KEDA
    WVA -.->|optional external metric| Adapter[prometheus-adapter]
    WVA -->|API server| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]

    %% Internal platform dependencies
    WVA -->|InferencePool watch + EPP scrape| GIE["gateway-api-inference-extension<br/>v1.2.1 InferencePool / EPP"]
    WVA -.->|conditional scale target| LWS["LeaderWorkerSet v0.8.0"]
    WVA -->|scale target| ModelServers["llm-d model servers<br/>vLLM"]
    WVA -->|"metrics backend, cluster-monitoring-view"| OCPMon["OpenShift monitoring"]
    WVA -->|"metrics cert + CA bundle"| ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"]
    WVA -->|GPU node labels| GPUOp["NVIDIA GPU operator"]
    KEDA -->|scales| ModelServers

